{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"3169","artifact_type":"T0-baseline","name":"T0-baseline-duplicate-detection-content-match@sha256:0f35486c7e2ee44f45ce857a9aae3ab4f9af69ae5e61800e0844528b4759969f"},"owner_reference":"3169","content":"---\n# T0 Baseline Capture: Issue #3169 - Duplicate Detection Content Matching\n# Captured: 2026-08-29\n# Issue: Duplicate detection matches title characters at write time, so it cannot tell a caller that the work already exists\n\nbaseline_capture:\n  timestamp: '2026-08-29T00:00:00Z'\n  github_issue: 3169\n  title: 'fix: Duplicate detection matches title characters at write time, so it cannot tell a caller that the work already exists'\n\nacceptance_criteria_baseline:\n  - criterion_id: dup-detect-content-match\n    description: 'Duplicate check currently uses title-only character similarity matching'\n    check_command: 'grep -A 10 \"def find_fuzzy_duplicates\" plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/parsing.py | grep -c \"SequenceMatcher\"'\n    baseline_result: 1\n    expected_final: 0\n    interpretation: 'SequenceMatcher found once at baseline; should be replaced by content-based matching'\n\n  - criterion_id: dup-detect-cache-refresh\n    description: 'Cache refresh defaults to False, making stale cache invisible'\n    check_command: 'grep -n \"from_github.*=.*False\" plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/server.py | wc -l'\n    baseline_result: 1\n    expected_final: 0\n    interpretation: 'Default cache-only behavior confirmed; fix must add refresh or staleness signaling'\n\n  - criterion_id: dup-detect-exception-shape\n    description: 'DuplicateItemError exists and carries tuple of (title, ratio, file_path)'\n    check_command: 'grep -c \"class DuplicateItemError\" plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/models.py'\n    baseline_result: 1\n    expected_final: 1\n    interpretation: 'Exception exists; its shape (file_path vs. item_id) is the issue, not its existence'\n\n  - criterion_id: dup-detect-cli-parity\n    description: 'CLI backlog list command lacks --search option for content-based matching'\n    check_command: 'grep -c \"\\-\\-search\" sam_schema/backlog.py'\n    baseline_result: 0\n    expected_final: 1\n    interpretation: 'No --search option found in CLI; must add to match documented MCP Step 3'\n\n  - criterion_id: dup-detect-test-coverage\n    description: 'Test files exist that lock current duplicate-detection mechanism'\n    check_command: 'find plugins/development-harness/tests_sam -name \"test_*.py\" -exec grep -l \"duplicate\" {} \\; | wc -l'\n    baseline_result: 11\n    expected_final: 11\n    interpretation: '11 test files reference duplicates; these tests must migrate from old mechanism'\n\nsummary:\n  problem_statement: |\n    The duplicate detection gate runs at write-time, uses title-only character-sequence matching,\n    returns non-actionable file paths, and reads stale cache. As a result:\n    - Differently-worded descriptions of the same problem are not flagged as duplicates\n    - Concurrent writes from other sessions are invisible (cache has not been pulled)\n    - Even when a duplicate is detected, the caller gets a file path, not an item reference\n    - The CLI path has no equivalent to the documented MCP Step 3 check\n  \n  acceptance_criteria_summary: |\n    1. Content-based matching (not title-only) \u2014 uses full-text search across title/description/criteria/sections\n    2. Detects or reports staleness \u2014 distinguishes \"nothing matches\" from \"could not check\"\n    3. Returns actionable item reference \u2014 caller can read existing item and extend it\n    4. CLI parity \u2014 backlog add command can execute Step 3 check without MCP-only tool\n    5. No regression \u2014 genuinely non-duplicate items remain unaffected\n  \n  implementation_scope: |\n    5 core files require changes:\n    - backlog_core/parsing.py::find_fuzzy_duplicates (replace algorithm)\n    - backlog_core/operations.py::_check_for_duplicates (rewire caller, result shape)\n    - backlog_core/operations.py::add_item (timing/coordination)\n    - backlog_core/models.py::DuplicateItemError (carry item id, not file path)\n    - backlog_core/backends/github_backend.py::list_work_items (add from_github param)\n    \n    2 consumer surfaces require updates:\n    - backlog_core/server.py::backlog_add (MCP tool)\n    - sam_schema/backlog.py::add and list_items (CLI commands)\n    \n    ~24 existing tests locked to current mechanism require migration\n    Documentation/workflow-graph refresh required via dh:meta-workflow-graph-refresh\n"}